<title>TOGO: SOCCER-TOGO BEAT CONGO 1-0 IN AFRICA NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TOGO BEAT CONGO 1-0 IN AFRICA NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LOME 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Togo beat Congo 1-0 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>in their African Nations Cup preliminary round, second leg </p>
<p>qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Salou Bachirou (53rd minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 18,000</p>
<p>Togo win 1-0 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
